m elementor-animation-float\" href=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/sample-page\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewBox=\"0 0 88.4 89.1\"><defs><style>      .st0 {        fill: #231f20;      }    <\/style><\/defs><polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"81.3 77.5 72.3 77.5 72.3 15.4 10.1 15.4 10.1 6.4 81.3 6.4 81.3 77.5\"><\/polygon><rect class=\"st0\" x=\"-3.7\" y=\"39.7\" width=\"94.3\" height=\"9\" transform=\"translate(-18.5 43.7) rotate(-45)\"><\/rect><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">ENQUIRE<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45370261 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"45370261\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16c6622 elementor-widget elementor-widget-page-title\" data-id=\"16c6622\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"page-title.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"hfe-page-title hfe-page-title-wrapper elementor-widget-heading\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tour story  \n\t\t\t<\/h2 > \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79ea9959 elementor-widget__width-initial animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79ea9959\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Kirima Rise is not built from nothing. It is built from a name, a legacy, and a promise that the land in Njiru would one day belong, lawfully and permanently, to the people who call it home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17ae992a elementor-widget__width-initial e-transform animated-slow elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"17ae992a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_rotateZ_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:90,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;,&quot;_transform_rotateZ_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_rotateZ_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2655fac7 elementor-align-left elementor-tablet-align-left animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"2655fac7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-float\" href=\"#next\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-long-arrow-alt-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M168 345.941V44c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-56c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v301.941H41.941c-21.382 0-32.09 25.851-16.971 40.971l86.059 86.059c9.373 9.373 24.569 9.373 33.941 0l86.059-86.059c15.119-15.119 4.411-40.971-16.971-40.971H168z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Explore <\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f231136 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-tl-post-fatured-image\" data-id=\"f231136\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"tl-post-fatured-image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"845\" src=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/story-title-deed-e1787405742215.jpg\" title=\"story-title-deed\" alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-462\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/story-title-deed-e1787405742215.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/story-title-deed-e1787405742215-300x248.jpg 300w, https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/story-title-deed-e1787405742215-768x634.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5bb054e8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5bb054e8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"next\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-667cf98 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"667cf98\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9af4cbd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9af4cbd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong> From Njiru <\/strong>to Kirima Rise\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db7d1ce elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"db7d1ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b868a6b elementor-drop-cap-yes elementor-drop-cap-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b868a6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;drop_cap&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>For years this place was known simply as Njiru Kirima land. A location on a map. A description of where something is, rather than what it is becoming. When the Estate set out to build a planned, serviced, properly titled community here, it began with the name.<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea5e670 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ea5e670\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb9345a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"eb9345a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ec9e9a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2ec9e9a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3af1fec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3af1fec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Why the Name Is Kirima Rise<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bde18be e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bde18be\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe0b0bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fe0b0bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Rise carries two meanings at the same time. As a noun it is a place: an incline, high ground, a position above the plain. As a verb it is movement: to rise is to become something more than you were. Both meanings are true of this place, and both are true of the man whose name it carries.<\/p><p>Gerishon Kirima rose. From a tea-picking childhood in Kangema to a carpenter&#8217;s bench on the Kinangop, from a carpenter&#8217;s bench to a trader&#8217;s counter, from a trader&#8217;s counter to the councils and Parliament of his country. The name is not decoration. It is the description of a life, applied to a place.<\/p><p>And because Rise is a direction rather than a destination, it is a name that cannot be outgrown. There is no point at which a community stops rising.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04ba371 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"04ba371\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cb4e61 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1cb4e61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-855a2eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"855a2eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>The Name Begins with Kirima<\/strong>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7594d42 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7594d42\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-909d455 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"909d455\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In the name Kirima Rise, Kirima comes first, and that is deliberate. The second word describes what kind of place this is. The first word says who stands behind it.<\/p><p>This is the same family, holding to the same belief the founder held: that ownership should be within reach of ordinary people, and that a place is worth building properly.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67c0cc6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"67c0cc6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b568ea7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b568ea7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b94749b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b94749b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>What Kirima Rise Is Becoming<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50c57b4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"50c57b4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cc684b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3cc684b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Kirima Rise is a planned community: surveyed, mapped, subdivided into individual plots, approved by county and national government, and moving steadily toward the issuance of individual titles.<\/p><p>It is roads and boundaries where there was open ground. It is addresses, where there were none. It is named courts and marked plots and most importantly, it is ownership.<\/p><p>In the founder&#8217;s own spirit, that social and economic prosperity must exist in the same space, the land that once fed Nairobi will now anchor a secure, owned and thriving community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1128b2e9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1128b2e9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-377a12a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"377a12a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-526af87c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"526af87c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19af3250 e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"19af3250\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-392e33ea elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"392e33ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/white-brand-mark.png\" title=\"white-brand mark\" alt=\"white-brand mark\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2fdf7db8 e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2fdf7db8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ani